{"audio": "2corinthians-02.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 125467, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2667, "text": "2 Corinthians, Chapter Two."}, {"start_ms": 2667, "end_ms": 7333, "text": "But I determined this with myself, that I would not come again to you in heaviness."}, {"start_ms": 7333, "end_ms": 13467, "text": "For if I make you sorry, who is he then that maketh me glad, but the same which is made sorry by me?"}, {"start_ms": 13467, "end_ms": 25067, "text": "And I wrote this same unto you, lest, when I came, I should have sorrow from them of whom I ought to rejoice; having confidence in you all, that my joy is the joy of you all."}, {"start_ms": 25067, "end_ms": 35867, "text": "For out of much affliction and anguish of heart I wrote unto you with many tears; not that ye should be grieved, but that ye might know the love which I have more abundantly unto you."}, {"start_ms": 35867, "end_ms": 41867, "text": "But if any have caused grief, he hath not grieved me, but in part: that I may not overcharge you all."}, {"start_ms": 41867, "end_ms": 46267, "text": "Sufficient to such a man is this punishment, which was inflicted of many."}, {"start_ms": 46267, "end_ms": 54133, "text": "So that contrariwise ye ought rather to forgive him, and comfort him, lest perhaps such a one should be swallowed up with overmuch sorrow."}, {"start_ms": 54133, "end_ms": 58000, "text": "Wherefore I beseech you that ye would confirm your love toward him."}, {"start_ms": 58000, "end_ms": 64933, "text": "For to this end also did I write, that I might know the proof of you, whether ye be obedient in all things."}, {"start_ms": 64933, "end_ms": 80800, "text": "To whom ye forgive any thing, I forgive also: for if I forgave any thing, to whom I forgave it, for your sakes forgave I it in the person of Christ; Lest Satan should get an advantage of us: for we are not ignorant of his devices."}, {"start_ms": 80800, "end_ms": 94000, "text": "Furthermore, when I came to Troas to preach Christ's gospel, and a door was opened unto me of the Lord, I had no rest in my spirit, because I found not Titus my brother: but taking my leave of them, I went from thence into Macedonia."}, {"start_ms": 94000, "end_ms": 102267, "text": "Now thanks be unto God, which always causeth us to triumph in Christ, and maketh manifest the savour of his knowledge by us in every place."}, {"start_ms": 102267, "end_ms": 114133, "text": "For we are unto God a sweet savour of Christ, in them that are saved, and in them that perish: To the one we are the savour of death unto death; and to the other the savour of life unto life."}, {"start_ms": 114133, "end_ms": 116667, "text": "And who is sufficient for these things?"}, {"start_ms": 116667, "end_ms": 125467, "text": "For we are not as many, which corrupt the word of God: but as of sincerity, but as of God, in the sight of God speak we in Christ."}], "words": [{"t": "2", "s": 0, "e": 1103, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 1103, "e": 1664, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1765, "e": 2126, "si": 0}, {"t": "Two.", "s": 2186, "e": 2406, "si": 0}, {"t": "But", "s": 3188, "e": 3288, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 3368, "e": 3388, "si": 1}, {"t": "determined", "s": 3428, "e": 3889, "si": 1}, {"t": "this", "s": 3889, "e": 4049, "si": 1}, {"t": "with", "s": 4109, "e": 4229, "si": 1}, {"t": "myself,", "s": 4269, "e": 4770, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 5230, "e": 5350, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 5431, "e": 5451, "si": 1}, {"t": "would", "s": 5451, "e": 5611, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 5631, "e": 5791, "si": 1}, {"t": "come", "s": 5851, "e": 6011, "si": 1}, {"t": "again", "s": 6031, "e": 6292, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 6352, "e": 6432, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 6492, "e": 6612, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 6712, "e": 6772, "si": 1}, {"t": "heaviness.", "s": 6832, "e": 7273, "si": 1}, {"t": "For", "s": 7554, "e": 7674, "si": 2}, {"t": "if", "s": 7714, "e": 7794, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 7914, "e": 7934, "si": 2}, {"t": "make", "s": 7995, 